Not your PC but likely your version of base-R, geomorph, and RRPP.  Earlier this fall R went to R 4.0, then 4.0.1 and 4.0.2. There were major changes to how various data structures are now handled, which caused cascading effects in many packages including geomorph and RRPP.  We’ve updated to accommodate, but this usually requires a fresh install of everything to sort out (at least, that seems to have solved similar issues that others have had: see prior threads on this list).

